==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Demon Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Akaza]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
All of the enemies in this stage are peons or at an extremely low magnification. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win. Beware of the next stage though, as it is a massive difficulty spike.

